### Criar uma Order
POST http://localhost:8080/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Cliente de teste",
  "description": "Pedido criado pelo arquivo api.http",
  "amount": 149.90
}

### Listar Orders via REST
GET http://localhost:8080/order
Accept: application/json

### Listar Orders via GraphQL
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ ListOrders { id customer description amount created_at } }"
}

### Criar Order via GraphQL
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { CreateOrder(customer: \"Cliente GraphQL\", description: \"Pedido de teste\", amount: 99.9) { id customer description amount created_at } }"
}
